    {
      "source": "Begin creating an <code>UPDATE</code> operation for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>domainType</code></a>创建一个<code>UPDATE</code>操作。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The starting domainType is used for mapping the <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> provided via <code>matching</code>, as well as\nthe <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> via <code>apply</code>.",
      "translation": "起始的 domainType 用于映射通过 <code>matching</code> 提供的 <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>，以及通过 <code>apply</code> 应用的 <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "By default, the table to operate on is derived from the initial domainType and can be defined there via\nthe <a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>Table</code></a> annotation. Using <code>inTable</code> allows a\ndeveloper to override the table name for the execution.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，要操作的表是从初始的 domainType 派生的，并可以通过<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/Table.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping 中的注解接口\"><code>Table</code></a>注解在此处定义。使用<code>inTable</code>允许开发人员覆盖执行时的表名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2017–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Define a <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> used as the filter for the <a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a>.",
      "translation": "定义一个用作<a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Update.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.relational.core.query.Update\"><code>Update</code></a>过滤器的<a href=\"../../relational/core/query/Query.html\" title=\"类 org.springframework.data.relational.core.query.Query\"><code>Query</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"ReactiveUpdateOperation.ReactiveUpdate.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core\"><code>ReactiveUpdateOperation.ReactiveUpdate</code></a> interface provides methods for constructing <code>UPDATE</code> operations in a fluent way.",
      "translation": "`ReactiveUpdateOperation.ReactiveUpdate` 接口提供了以流畅方式构建 `UPDATE` 操作的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Trigger <code>UPDATE</code> execution by calling one of the terminating methods.",
      "translation": "通过调用终止方法之一来触发<code>UPDATE</code>执行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Table override (optional).",
      "translation": "表覆盖（可选）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - if <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>domainType</code></a> is null.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalArgumentException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalArgumentException</a></code> - 如果 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>domainType</code></a> 为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>domainType</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> of domain object to update; must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>domainType</code> - 要更新的域对象的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>type</code></a>；不能为 null。",
